      data:
        waveDescription: Learn To Attack
        waveStartText:
          frames:
          - name: Barkeeper
            chatContent: When attacking, you will be presented with an Attack Compass.
              Its needle represents your sword's direction.
            portrait: {fileID: 866953318, guid: d1a0ca5211c3884cbb0d80af09011836, type: 3}
            chatterVoice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 65b3fc3a5355944d6b632355a061e2b2, type: 2}
            OnFrameCompleted:
              m_PersistentCalls:
                m_Calls: []
            displayMode: 1
            preventTextSkipping: 0
            preventTextContinuing: 0
            autoProgressOnComplete: 0
          - name: Barkeeper
            chatContent: Using it, you can choose the direction and distance of your
              swing. A further swing does more damage, but burns more of your power.
            portrait: {fileID: 866953318, guid: d1a0ca5211c3884cbb0d80af09011836, type: 3}
            chatterVoice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 65b3fc3a5355944d6b632355a061e2b2, type: 2}
            OnFrameCompleted:
              m_PersistentCalls:
                m_Calls: []
            displayMode: 1
            preventTextSkipping: 0
            preventTextContinuing: 0
            autoProgressOnComplete: 0
          - name: Barkeeper
            chatContent: The flame in your heart represents your current power! The
              brighter it burns, the stronger you are, and the more you can swing,
              so try not to let it burn out!
            portrait: {fileID: -751729575, guid: d1a0ca5211c3884cbb0d80af09011836, type: 3}
            chatterVoice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 65b3fc3a5355944d6b632355a061e2b2, type: 2}
